.SS "docutils\&.transforms\&.frontmatter\&.TitlePromoter\&.promote_subtitle ( self,  node)"

.PP
.nf
Transform the following node tree::

    <node>
        <title>
        <section>
            <title>
            \&.\&.\&.

into ::

    <node>
        <title>
        <subtitle>
        \&.\&.\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.SS "docutils\&.transforms\&.frontmatter\&.TitlePromoter\&.promote_title ( self,  node)"

.PP
.nf
Transform the following tree::

    <node>
        <section>
            <title>
            \&.\&.\&.

into ::

    <node>
        <title>
        \&.\&.\&.

`node` is normally a document\&.

.fi
